flowchart TB
    %% 目標設計示意，非已實作元件清單。固定版面由同名 SVG／PNG 表達。
    %% Module 是功能分類／契約，Component 是可註冊實作；預設提供不代表全部同時執行。
    subgraph ENGINE["RAG Engine｜各 Module 的內建與擴充 Components"]
        direction LR
        subgraph PARSING["Module：Parsing"]
            direction TB
            P0["預設提供：Records Parser"]
            P1["Developer 擴充：TeamParser（示意）"]
        end
        subgraph CHUNKING["Module：Chunking"]
            direction TB
            C0["預設提供：Fixed-size／Recursive／Header-aware"]
            C1["Developer 擴充：TeamChunker（示意）"]
        end
        subgraph INDEXING["Module：Indexing"]
            direction TB
            I0["預設提供：Elasticsearch／Local Search"]
            I1["Developer 擴充：TeamIndexer（示意）"]
        end
    end

    DEV["Module Developer｜選 Module、開發 Component"] --> CHECK["測試＋PR 審查｜驗證契約與設定"]
    CHECK --> UPDATE["發布並更新 RAG Engine｜內建＋核可自訂 Components"]
    UPDATE -->|納入目標 Runtime| ENGINE
    ENGINE -. "Component 目錄＋Config Schema" .-> UI["RAG Builder User｜選 Component、填參數"]

    classDef builtin fill:#e9f2ff,stroke:#6086c8,color:#143054
    classDef custom fill:#eee9fa,stroke:#9380bf,color:#443267
    classDef delivery fill:#fff5e5,stroke:#cf9b4a,color:#624516
    classDef builder fill:#ecf8f2,stroke:#599d85,color:#153f32
    class P0,C0,I0 builtin
    class P1,C1,I1,DEV custom
    class CHECK,UPDATE delivery
    class UI builder
    style ENGINE fill:#f7faff,stroke:#9aafc9
    style PARSING fill:#fff,stroke:#9aafc9
    style CHUNKING fill:#fff,stroke:#9aafc9
    style INDEXING fill:#fff,stroke:#9aafc9
